      <h1 id="ai-page-title">Explore artificial intelligence and machine learning resources</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">Discover maize genetic variants, protein language models, predicted 3D structures, functional annotations, and machine-learning-ready multi-omics datasets.</p>
