  <section id="ai-featured" class="ai-featured" aria-labelledby="ai-featured-title">
    <div class="ai-featured-copy">
      <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-ok">New Featured Workspace</span>
      <h2 id="ai-featured-title">SNPTools&#58; One workspace for maize SNP discovery and interpretation</h2>
      <p>SNPTools brings variant search, visualization, comparison, functional interpretation, and downstream analysis into a connected MaizeGDB toolkit.</p>
      <ul class="ai-feature-list">
        <li><strong>Build targeted variant views</strong><span>Select a B73 v5 interval or gene model and choose accessions from diverse maize datasets.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Inspect richer evidence</strong><span>Review alleles, predicted effects, and DNA or protein language-model scores in an interactive table.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Keep analysis moving</strong><span>Download VCF output or send a selection to comparison, impact, function, structure, tree, and PanEffect workflows.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="ai-feature-actions">
        <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" href="https\://snptools.maizegdb.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open SNPTools <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
        <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary" href="https\://snptools.maizegdb.org/#help" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Help &amp; FAQ <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-workflow" aria-label="SNPTools workflow">
      <div class="ai-workflow-heading"><span>Connected workflow</span><strong>Start with a region. Continue with evidence.</strong></div>
      <ol>
        <li><span>01</span><div><strong>Choose</strong><small>Dataset, interval, gene, and accessions</small></div></li>
        <li><span>02</span><div><strong>Explore</strong><small>Variants, alleles, effects, and model scores</small></div></li>
        <li><span>03</span><div><strong>Compare</strong><small>Accessions, functional evidence, and relationships</small></div></li>
        <li><span>04</span><div><strong>Export</strong><small>Download a focused VCF or continue in another tool</small></div></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="ai-suite-list" aria-label="SNPTools applications">
        <span>SNPVersity</span><span>SNPImpact</span><span>SNPFunction</span><span>SNPFold</span><span>SNPCompare</span><span>SNPTree</span><span>PanEffect</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

