  <section id="ai-tools" class="ai-section" aria-labelledby="ai-tools-title">
    <div class="ai-section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Analyze &amp; interpret</span>
        <h2 id="ai-tools-title">MaizeGDB analysis tools</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Purpose-built web applications for functional enrichment, variant effects, protein structures, and multi-omics feature analysis.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-card-grid ai-card-grid-tools">
      <article class="ai-resource-card ai-tool-card" data-ai-resource data-ai-category="tool" data-ai-search="FETA functional enrichment genes gene ontology zea mays">
        <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-ok">Functional enrichment</span>
        <h3>FETA</h3>
        <p>Explore gene functional enrichment in <i>Zea mays</i> and related species.</p>
        <a class="ai-card-cta" href="https\://feta.maizegdb.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open FETA <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="ai-resource-card ai-tool-card" data-ai-resource data-ai-category="tool" data-ai-search="PanEffect missense amino acid substitution variant effects pangenome B73">
        <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-info">Variant effects</span>
        <h3>PanEffect</h3>
        <p>Visualize predicted missense effects for B73 substitutions and natural variation across the maize pan-genome.</p>
        <a class="ai-card-cta" href="/effect/maize_v2/">Open PanEffect <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="ai-resource-card ai-tool-card" data-ai-resource data-ai-category="tool" data-ai-search="protein structure Foldseek FATCAT Diamond comparison predicted proteins">
        <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-warn">Protein structure</span>
        <h3>Structure resources</h3>
        <p>View predicted maize structures, search proteomes with Foldseek, and compare ortholog predictions with FATCAT.</p>
        <div class="ai-card-links">
          <a href="/data_center/protein_structure">Browse structures &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/foldseek">Foldseek &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/fatcat">FATCAT &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ai-resource-card ai-tool-card" data-ai-resource data-ai-category="tool" data-ai-search="Maize Feature Store machine learning gene features multiomics data exploration MFS">
        <span class="mgdb-pill mgdb-pill-ok">Machine-learning features</span>
        <h3>Maize Feature Store</h3>
        <p>Explore centralized, gene-based maize features prepared for machine-learning applications.</p>
        <a class="ai-card-cta" href="https\://mfs.maizegdb.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Feature Store <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="ai-data" class="ai-section ai-section-tinted" aria-labelledby="ai-data-title">
    <div class="ai-section-heading">
