        <span class="ai-data-label">Feature vectors</span>
        <h3>Extended-17k</h3>
        <p>An expansive collection of approximately 17,000 genetic and genomic attributes for each B73 gene annotation.</p>
        <div class="ai-tags"><span>B73 v5</span><span>High dimensional</span></div>
        <a href="https\://iastate.app.box.com/v/maizegdb-public/folder/362581772989" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download dataset &nearr;</a>
