        <p>Machine-learning GO predictions plus sequence- and structure-informed UniProt annotations.</p>
        <div class="ai-card-links">
          <a href="https\://download.maizegdb.org/GeneFunction_and_Expression/Pannzer_GO_Terms/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GO terms &nearr;</a>
          <a href="https\://download.maizegdb.org/GeneFunction_and_Expression/FASSO_AlphaFold_Orthologs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FASSO annotations &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ai-resource-card ai-data-card" data-ai-resource data-ai-category="data" data-ai-search="curated literature manuscripts manual annotation gene publication B73">
        <span class="ai-data-label">Training and evaluation</span>
        <h3>Curated literature</h3>
        <p>More than two decades of curator- and community-supplied manuscript annotations linked to maize records.</p>
        <div class="ai-tags"><span>B73 v5</span><span>B73 v4</span></div>
        <a href="https\://iastate.app.box.com/v/maizegdb-public/folder/362581211707" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download dataset &nearr;</a>
      </article>

      <article class="ai-resource-card ai-data-card" data-ai-resource data-ai-category="data" data-ai-search="AlphaFold2 ESMFold protein structures embeddings ESM ProtBERT T5 language model NAM W22">
        <span class="ai-data-label">Protein representations</span>
        <h3>Structures &amp; embeddings</h3>
        <p>AlphaFold2 and ESMFold structures plus ESM, ProtBERT, and T5 protein-language-model embeddings.</p>
        <div class="ai-card-links">
          <a href="https\://iastate.app.box.com/v/maizegdb-public/folder/362582492660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AlphaFold2 &nearr;</a>
          <a href="https\://iastate.app.box.com/v/maizegdb-public/folder/362581729713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ESMFold &nearr;</a>
          <a href="https\://iastate.app.box.com/v/maizegdb-public/folder/362582591980" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Embeddings &nearr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ai-resource-card ai-data-card" data-ai-resource data-ai-category="data" data-ai-search="variant effect scores esm variants protein language model PlantCAD B73 W22 NAM genomes">
        <span class="ai-data-label">Variant prioritization</span>
        <h3>Variant effect scores</h3>
        <p>ESM protein-language-model scores for substitutions across B73, W22, NAM founders, and additional maize genomes.</p>
        <div class="ai-tags"><span>Pan-genome</span><span>ESM variants</span></div>
        <a href="https\://iastate.app.box.com/v/maizegdb-public/folder/362583128761" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download scores &nearr;</a>
      </article>

      <article class="ai-resource-card ai-data-card" data-ai-resource data-ai-category="data" data-ai-search="metabolic pathways E2P2 CornCyc AraCyc OryzaCyc SAVI B73 NAM">
        <span class="ai-data-label">Pathway annotation</span>
        <h3>Metabolic pathways</h3>
        <p>E2P2 enzyme predictions and validated pathway assignments using CornCyc, AraCyc, OryzaCyc, and SAVI evidence.</p>
        <div class="ai-tags"><span>B73 v5</span><span>NAM founders</span></div>
        <a href="https\://download.maizegdb.org/GeneFunction_and_Expression/E2P2_pathways/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download pathways &nearr;</a>
      </article>
    </div>
